     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«かえって»: the opposite of what was expected",
     "texto": [
      "It shows the result was the opposite of, or less favourable than, expected: **やすみ な のに、 でかけたら かえって つかれました** (although it was my day off, going out left me more tired)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«むしろ»: rather, better",
     "texto": [
      "To present an option as preferable or more suitable in that situation: **つかれた ので、 むしろ ねたい です** (as I'm tired, I'd rather sleep).",
      "It sounds like a choice between options."
